  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe editor uses the body bands for its holder when a body exists.\nIt removes the parameter holder from the fill, outline and frame calculation.\nA tool without a body keeps its parameter profile.\n\n## Cause\n\n`draw_tool_preview` painted the full `Tool::profile()` and then painted the body over it.\nCollision checking uses `tool_body::judged` and `tool_body::stack` to replace an explicit parameter holder with the body bands.\nThe viewport and simulation use those bands through `sim_tool_body::for_operation`.\nThe separate conservative parameter floor for assumed machine-default holders is tracked in #2009.\nThis PR changes editor paint only.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `tool_preview_body_replaces_parameter_holder_fill`\n- `tool_preview_body_replaces_parameter_holder_outline`\n- `tool_preview_body_sets_frame_without_parameter_holder`\n- `tool_preview_without_body_keeps_parameter_holder`\n\nThe three body pins failed before the fix.\nThe no-body control passed.\nThe mutation restored upstream production code with identical test registration.\nThe three body pins failed again.\nRestoring the fix passed all four tests.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed the UI library and boundary, boundary_picks, sinker_setup and theme_files suites.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\n\n## Tool editor before and after\n\nBoth renders use the same tool and imported body: an Ø8 mm cutter, 20 mm flute,\n40 mm shank, Ø60 × 60 mm parameter holder, and Ø24 × 20 mm body from z60 to z80.\nThese are headless renders of the actual tool editor at 1600 × 1400.\nBefore uses the parent preview function; after uses head `5e127955b69e032cfeac51f89d7a434b63b5ef8e`.\n\nBefore: the gray parameter holder overlaps the amber body and sets a 120 mm overall frame.\n\n![Before: parameter holder overlaps tool body](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/05173e65caf23e7559f089362140f377c7e63598/2010/before.png)\n\nAfter: the body replaces the parameter holder and sets an 80 mm overall frame.\n\n![After: body replaces parameter holder](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/05173e65caf23e7559f089362140f377c7e63598/2010/after.png)\n\nImages are stored only on the fork's images-only `pr-screenshots` branch.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nThe NC and CL diff stat is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo manual desktop session or physical machining.\nThe machine-default conservative floor remains separate work in #2009.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n#2001, #1931 and #1717 touch `pages.rs`, different functions from `draw_tool_preview`; whichever merges second refreshes.\nNo stacked dependency.\n\nEffort: medium.\nBased on upstream/main cda3d5896, after v0.21.0.\n\nChangelog: The tool editor preview shows a tool body in place of the overlapping parameter holder.\n\nFixes #2005\n\n",
